_s3_endpoint","label":"S3 endpoint (host:port, no scheme)","description":"Example: fsn1.your-objectstorage.com:443. Do not include https:// or a path.","validRegex":"/^[^\\\\s/:]+(?::[0-9]{1,5})?$/"},{"id":"$$cap_s3_access_key_id","label":"S3 access key ID","description":"Access key for a dedicated Milvus bucket or prefix.","validRegex":"/.{1,}/"},{"id":"$$cap_s3_secret_access_key","label":"S3 secret access key","description":"Secret key for the S3-compatible object storage.","validRegex":"/.{1,}/"},{"id":"$$cap_s3_bucket","label":"S3 bucket","defaultValue":"milvus","description":"Dedicated bucket for Milvus vector/index/WAL object storage.","validRegex":"/^[a-z0-9][a-z0-9.-]{1,61}[a-z0-9]$/"},{"id":"$$cap_s3_root_path","label":"S3 root path","defaultValue":"milvus","description":"Stable object-key prefix used by Milvus inside the bucket. Do not change it after data exists.","validRegex":"/^[A-Za-z0-9._/-]{1,120}$/"},{"id":"$$cap_s3_use_ssl","label":"Use SSL for S3","defaultValue":"true","description":"Keep true for normal HTTPS S3-compatible endpoints.","validRegex":"/^(true|false)$/"},{"id":"$$cap_s3_use_virtual_host","label":"Use virtual-host S3 addressing","defaultValue":"true","description":"Recommended for AWS S3 and Hetzner Object Storage. Set false only if your provider requires path-style requests.","validRegex":"/^(true|false)$/"},{"id":"$$cap_s3_region","label":"S3 region","defaultValue":"us-east-1","description":"Provider region, for example us-east-1 or the region required by your S3 provider.","validRegex":"/.{1,}/"}],"instructions":{"start":"Milvus Standalone will be deployed privately with etcd metadata storage and external S3-compatible object storage.\n\nBefore continuing, create a dedicated S3 bucket and credentials. The endpoint must be host:port without http:// or https://.\n\nThis template intentionally does not install MinIO: bulk Milvus vector/index/WAL data belongs on external S3, while only etcd metadata and bounded Milvus working data stay